OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FWhen Tzeli Hadjidimitriou made a
OL,17,     Ftrip to a quiet Greek island
OL,18,     Fbeach, she simply wanted a rest.
OL,19,     FInstead, after two days there, her
OL,20,     Flife took on a new direction and
OL,21,     Fmeaning.
